Package: loomer
Type: Package
Title: Auxiliary Functions to Work with Lifelines Register Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Ilya",
      family = "Kashnitsky",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "ilya.kashnitsky@gmail.com",
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1835-8687")
    )
  )
Description: Provides high-performance utilities and helper workflows for
    cohort construction, date handling, categorical integer encoding, and 
    lexis-type transformations on longitudinal individual-level register 
    lifelines data. Optimized for large-scale demographic and epidemiological 
    datasets using modern fastverse and tidyverse backends.
